OL,3,GNEWSARape arrest after man attacked in
OL,4,Aalley
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have made an arrest after a man
OL,7,Fwas raped in Slough.
OL,9,FThe victim, who is in his 20s, was
OL,10,Fapproached while walking down a long
OL,11,Falley just beyond Pickford Gardens
OL,12,Fbetween 01:00 and 01:30 BST on 23
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FA 23-year-old man, from
OL,16,FStockton-on-Tees, County Durham, was
OL,17,Farrested on Friday on suspicion of
OL,18,Frape.
OL,20,FHe has since been released on
OL,21,Fconditional bail as officers' enquiries
OL,22,Fcontinue.
